make a CLI with following functions :

display name
display available commands
make mongodb dbs
modify files inside mongodb dbs 

CLI cmd : 
blogwriter -o (open and show the text once + show commands)
blogwriter -h (show only available commands)
blogwriter -in <dbs> create <file_name> (create a markdown file with name <file_name>)
blogwriter -make <dbs_name> (make a new mongoDB database using mongosh)
blogwriter -in <dbs_name> open <file_name> (open the file <file_name> from dbs <dbs_name> in nano)
blogwriter -connect <dbs_name> to <repository_name> (move dbs to the repository <reposiotry_name>)


cli name : blogwriter



